	| Product       | DXP Production                                     |
	| Type          | Virtual Cluster                                    |
	| Details       | Maximum Cluster Nodes: 5                           |
	| Status        | ACTIVE                                             |
	| Complimentary | false                                              |
	And the "Active" license tab should have the count value "4"
	And the "Expired" license tab should have the count value "0"
	And the "Deactivated" license tab should have the count value "0"
	And the "All" license tab should have the count value "4"
	When I click on the "Expired" license tab
	Then I should not be able to view the license with the keyword "Perlic - ${staticProjectName} License1 Name" on the subscription details page
	And I should not be able to view the license with the keyword "Perlic - ${staticProjectName} License2 Name" on the subscription details page
	When I click on the "Deactivated" license tab
